  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Summerville, SC\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Summerville, SC\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSummerville, SC\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n843.216.1331\n319 E 3rd N St\nSummerville, SC 29483\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nMon-Fri: 8 am-5 pm\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital - serving Summerville and North Charleston.\nWe are located in Summerville near the intersection of Main St and Hwy 78. We also serve pets and their families throughout the greater Charleston area.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care 24/7 in case of a pet emergency. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nWe’re open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week and 365 days a year to provide emergency care for pets with urgent medical needs. Our skilled clinicians deliver remarkable care when your pet’s primary veterinarian’s office may be closed. If your pet is experiencing any of the following signs or symptoms, we’re here to help:\nPain or significant discomfort\nInjury or trauma\nProlonged diarrhea or vomiting\nChanges in activity level or breathing\nDifficulty urinating\nNo appointment is necessary for our emergency vet services, but if possible, please call ahead at\n843.216.7554\nto let us know you’re coming.\nSpecialty care\nAvailable by referral, the veterinarians at BluePearl Pet Hospital treat pets with complex or chronic illnesses and injuries. Our services are available for pets who need specialty diagnostics, treatments or procedures.\nOur goal is to provide the highest quality veterinary care possible by acting as an extension of your primary care veterinarian. We do this by nurturing a strong relationship with you and your veterinarian through open communication, recommendations and treatment by our trained specialists, access to advanced technology and support care by our compassionate staff.\nLearn more about the\nveterinary specialties and services offered\nat our Summerville hospital.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nMeet our sister hospital.\nWe have locations in Summerville and Mount Pleasant to make it convenient for pet owners in the greater Charleston area to have access to specialty veterinary and emergency care.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital – Mount Pleasant\n985 Johnnie Dodds Blvd.\nMount Pleasant, SC 29464\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n843.216.7554\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nCurrent location.\n843.216.1331\n319 E 3rd N St\nSummerville,\nSC                                    29483\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nMount Pleasant, SC\n985 Johnnie Dodds Blvd.\nMount Pleasant, SC 29464\n843.216.7554\n22.78 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSavannah, GA\n335 Stephenson Ave\nSavannah, GA 31405\n912.354.6681\n88.62 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nAugusta, GA\n410 Topgolf Way\nAugusta, GA 30909\n706.733.7458\n112.11 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
